    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138785333255
    m_Localized: After landing <color=#94FF40>{0} hits, Bastet creates a Blessing
      Field for <color=#C58CFF>{1}s, increasing the SPD of allies within by <color=#42D9FF>{2}%
      and their HP by <color=#63E36F>{3}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138785333256
    m_Localized: Each skill cast grants 1 Forest Arrow. Upon reaching <color=#94FF40>{0}
      arrows, they are automatically fired, each dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% ATK
      to the nearest enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138785333257
    m_Localized: Starts with <color=#FFD84A>{0}% Crit Rate. Each critical hit grants
      an additional <color=#94FF40>{1}% for <color=#C58CFF>{2}s, stacking up to <color=#94FF40>{3}
      times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138785333258
    m_Localized: After <color=#94FF40>{0} basic attacks, Ophelia enters Rising Tide
      for <color=#C58CFF>{1}s, increasing SPD by <color=#42D9FF>{2}% and Final DMG
      by <color=#FF8A3D>{3}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527552
    m_Localized: After skills land <color=#94FF40>{0} hits, Hatshepsut enters Desert
      Dominion for <color=#C58CFF>{1}s, increasing Skill DMG by <color=#FF8A3D>{2}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527553
    m_Localized: After skills land <color=#94FF40>{0} hits, Brandon-Lowen enters
      Flame Soul for <color=#C58CFF>{1}s, increasing Skill DMG by <color=#FF8A3D>{2}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527554
    m_Localized: After <color=#94FF40>{0} basic attacks, Robert enters Rapid Fire
      for <color=#C58CFF>{1}s, increasing SPD by <color=#42D9FF>{2}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527555
    m_Localized: After <color=#94FF40>{0} basic attacks, Edward enters Gale for <color=#C58CFF>{1}s,
      increasing ATK by <color=#FF8A3D>{2}% and Crit Rate by <color=#FFD84A>{3}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527556
    m_Localized: After skills deal damage or restore HP <color=#94FF40>{0} times,
      Amelia enters Water Dance for <color=#C58CFF>{1}s, increasing Skill DMG by
      <color=#FF8A3D>{2}% and healing effectiveness by <color=#63E36F>{3}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527557
    m_Localized: After <color=#94FF40>{0} basic attacks, Jerolur activates Holy Sword
      for <color=#C58CFF>{1}s, increasing SPD by <color=#42D9FF>{2}% and Crit Rate
      by <color=#FFD84A>{3}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527558
    m_Localized: After attacks or skills hit a target <color=#94FF40>{0} times, Riddle
      activates Royal Authority for <color=#C58CFF>{1}s, increasing ATK by <color=#FF8A3D>{2}%
      for himself and nearby allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527559
    m_Localized: Gains 1 stack of Frost Armor every <color=#94FF40>{0}s. Each stack
      increases DEF by <color=#6FA8FF>{1}% and reflects damage equal to <color=#FF8A3D>{2}%
      ATK. At <color=#94FF40>{3} stacks, gains a shield equal to <color=#94FF40>{4}%
      Max HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138789527560
    m_Localized: Each attack grants 1 Water Note, while casting the Ultimate grants
      <color=#94FF40>{0} notes. Each note increases Skill DMG by <color=#FF8A3D>{1}%;
      at <color=#94FF40>{2} notes, activates Resonance for <color=#C58CFF>{3}s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721856
    m_Localized: Bastet unleashes <color=#94FF40>{0} assassination waves, each dealing
      <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% ATK to up to <color=#94FF40>{2} enemies. When a target
      is defeated, immediately unleashes 1 additional wave across the entire battlefield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721857
    m_Localized: Summons the Ancient Forest for <color=#C58CFF>{0}s, creating <color=#94FF40>{1}
      waves of wooden spikes. Each wave deals <color=#FF8A3D>{2}% ATK as Nature DMG
      and automatically switches targets when an enemy is defeated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721858
    m_Localized: Emily dashes through the enemy formation and slashes <color=#94FF40>{0}
      times, each dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% ATK. After casting, increases Crit
      Rate by <color=#FFD84A>{2}% for <color=#C58CFF>{3}s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721859
    m_Localized: Fires <color=#94FF40>{0} Moon Waves through targets in a fan-shaped
      area, each dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% ATK. Enemies caught in overlapping areas
      can be hit multiple times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721860
    m_Localized: Summons <color=#94FF40>{0} sand meteors at the area with the most
      enemies, each dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% ATK to all enemies within the area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721861
    m_Localized: Fires a stream of blazing light for <color=#C58CFF>{0}s, dealing
      <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% ATK every <color=#94FF40>{2}s to all enemies in a straight
      line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721862
    m_Localized: Unleashes a cone-shaped barrage for <color=#C58CFF>{0}s with <color=#94FF40>{1}
      hits, each dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{2}% ATK to enemies within the firing area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721863
    m_Localized: Creates a zigzag tornado across the battlefield, dealing <color=#94FF40>{0}
      hits. Each hit deals <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% ATK, knocks enemies back, and stuns
      them for <color=#C58CFF>{2}s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721864
    m_Localized: Creates a Tidal Zone for <color=#C58CFF>{0}s, dealing <color=#94FF40>{1}
      hits. Each hit deals <color=#FF8A3D>{2}% ATK. When the zone ends, it explodes
      and deals an additional <color=#FF8A3D>{3}% ATK.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721865
    m_Localized: Summons <color=#94FF40>{0} Holy Swords for <color=#C58CFF>{1}s.
      Each basic attack launches an additional sword, dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{2}%
      ATK to enemies ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721866
    m_Localized: Creates a Royal Domain for <color=#C58CFF>{0}s. Allies within gain
      <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% ATK and <color=#42D9FF>{2}% SPD, while enemies lose <color=#6FA8FF>{3}%
      DEF.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721867
    m_Localized: Creates an ice rift that deals <color=#FF8A3D>{0}% ATK plus <color=#FF8A3D>{1}%
      Max HP to up to <color=#94FF40>{2} targets and Freezes them for <color=#C58CFF>{3}s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5034138793721868
    m_Localized: Creates <color=#94FF40>{0} waves, each dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{1}%
      MATK. The waves then explode, dealing <color=#FF8A3D>{2}% MATK and slowing
      enemies by <color=#94FF40>{3}% for <color=#C58CFF>{4}s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
